    "\n",
    "## Determinante einer $3\\times3$-Matrix mit der Regel von Sarrus\n",
    "\n",
    "Gegeben sei die Matrix\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\vec A=\n",
    "\\begin{pmatrix}\n",
    "1 & 2 & -1\\\\\n",
    "2 & 1 & 3\\\\\n",
    "1 & -2 & 2\n",
    "\\end{pmatrix}.\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "Berechnen Sie die Determinante\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\det(\\vec A)\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "mit der **Regel von Sarrus**.\n",
    "\n"
   ]
  }
